{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:settingsHealthShareOffTitle", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "settingsHealthShareOffTitle", "text": "Contribution off", "sha256": "072314dace89d4ef0e0c124e4fdc47501f3412d024e7abf1fac794425b300b82", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:settingsHealthShareOffNeverUploaded", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "settingsHealthShareOffNeverUploaded", "text": "Nothing was ever uploaded. Nothing will be.", "sha256": "020421d0ddf78066c280367d88b74a4ee6740577281079d1ea0524c28489b917", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:settingsHealthShareOffDetail", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "settingsHealthShareOffDetail", "text": "Nothing further will be uploaded.\n\nOne copy of your database was uploaded on {date}. The server keeps only the most recent copy per device. We tried to tell it your consent is withdrawn — that message is sent once and is not retried, so if this phone is offline it will not have arrived, and we cannot show you that the copy is gone either.", "sha256": "0562287edce2a93bbb857272b98bc4a160b0b3225a59896e516d1d62f994f55a", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:settingsOk", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "settingsOk", "text": "OK", "sha256": "565339bc4d33d72817b583024112eb7f5cdf3e5eef0252d6ec1b9c9a94e12bb3", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:settingsHealthShareOnTitle", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "settingsHealthShareOnTitle", "text": "Contribute your health data?", "sha256": "eb20ce0bb2969f00a058c0bafd7a225ac81b4ff363ae0e4d8ea6ea776164a455", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:settingsHealthShareOnBody", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "settingsHealthShareOnBody", "text": "Once a day, on Wi-Fi and while charging, a compressed copy of your ENTIRE database is uploaded — every derived day and every raw sensor row the band has sent. It is used to improve the algorithms.\n\nIt is not anonymous in any meaningful sense: it is your whole health history. You can switch this off at any time, and nothing further is sent from that moment.", "sha256": "16b0df3d090b31c021b7460835b755db177046759585d3a412c23f8ab09daab2", "kind": "arb"}
